review_comments.body:
Be smart to split this type out of service.nix maybe into a file called `notificationProtocol.nix` just to make it easier for people who have created a custom readiness protocol to add support for it in modular services. See below:
```nix
{
	notificationProtocol =  {
		systemd = true; 
		s6 = true;
		redox = true; # Socket activation
		windows = true; # Windows AppReadiness
		openrc = true; 
		dinit = true; 
		runinit = true;
		rc-d = true;
		launchd = true; # Socket activation
	};
}
```

